3
00:00:04.114 --> 00:00:06.560
That work has real uses.

4
00:00:06.891 --> 00:00:08.776
Body mass index is weight

5
00:00:08.776 --> 00:00:11.165
in kilograms divided by height

6
00:00:11.165 --> 00:00:11.942
in metres,

7
00:00:11.942 --> 00:00:12.993
squared.

8
00:00:13.682 --> 00:00:16.457
Below 18.5 is underweight.

9
00:00:16.457 --> 00:00:20.308
18.5 to 24.9 is normal.

10
00:00:20.308 --> 00:00:23.395
25 and above is overweight.

11
00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:27.285
Forensic anthropology identifies remains.

12
00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:28.990
Others work in nutrition,

13
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.433
health, and ergonomic design.

14
00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:32.993
Your turn.

15
